### peticiones para probar clientes

### Listar clientes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/clientes

### Filtrar clientes por nombre
GET http://localhost:8080/api/clientes?nombre=Ana

### Crear cliente
POST http://localhost:8080/api/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Marina Dor",
  "telefono": "611222333",
  "email": "marina@email.com",
  "matricula": "2468JKL"
}

### Obtener cliente por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/clientes/1


### Actualizar cliente
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/clientes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Aitor Tilla",
  "telefono": "600111222",
  "email": "aitor@email.com",
  "matricula": "1234ABC"
}

### Reparaciones de un cliente
GET http://localhost:8080/api/clientes/1/reparaciones

### Gasto total del cliente
GET http://localhost:8080/api/clientes/1/gasto-total

### Borrar cliente
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/clientes/4
